{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_26fd0aa196864f80c78d750a6cf81ab7d1158e9aa714f66b80ad88b32b8371d4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions go through GitHub pull requests, all submissions require review, and a Contributor License Agreement must accompany contributions."}],"claim_ids":["clm_26fd0aa196864f80c78d750a6cf81ab7d1158e9aa714f66b80ad88b32b8371d4"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:53:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_08dfd3b3941848cc9e8516464be4b02f","id":"pg_5d5445d019af5e9d9ac34735db197509","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/google-deepmind-code-contests-contributing-md-fa7a4f8139aa-4735db197509.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_aabafbc15bb553bbb177ad768aed6ac1"],"title":"google-deepmind/code_contests/CONTRIBUTING.md @ fa7a4f8139aa","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:53:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_08dfd3b3941848cc9e8516464be4b02f"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_07c2fe0eeb7dd3b3e50d6f3e3ee07bae15f6d9cecd85064e41d47a2e6b999c73"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The repository is supported on Linux compiled with clang; MacOS and Windows users have reported build errors in GitHub issues."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0b9ab5d50e1a1a887dad8db121ddcb8a16735adc9e978b77f6c423fdc524bc73"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Problems include paired input/output test cases plus both correct and incorrect human solutions in a variety of languages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1b7f04d36f08057e4252ac736d43103c706ea032ada072818dae44ce2581f1c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Execution code defaults to Python 3.9 and 2.7 at /usr/bin paths, configurable via flags defined in py_locations.cc such as --python3_path."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2df4093a9cebba46c03cda5c437d2f064020739e09051d55a20bef9cc3697daa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Attached solutions are not guaranteed to compile or execute identically to their original contest environment; some fail compilation or produce sandbox violations, especially incorrect ones."},{"claim_ids":["clm_344f4a70c35524f948999c54cdbcb5abe1a655f88a4b5fa9ff74b9db9c8b3301"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Data is stored as ContestProblem protocol buffers in Riegeli format, with the schema and field documentation in contest_problem.proto."},{"claim_ids":["clm_484d61549efb9f11c5b3c1bec2129f01055e61a406dbd96c0ee7cb997cab2755"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The full dataset is about 3 GiB and is downloaded from a Google Cloud Storage bucket using gsutil from the Cloud SDK."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5f3e087ab877ed1d85c85610a931507edd27ae4fa49c0505cc1f3b7d3171131b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CodeContests is a competitive programming dataset for machine learning, and it was used when training AlphaCode, which was published in Science with an arXiv preprint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5f4dd3fb28de0a20c6bc36f2fdfa5f3b9fae36bb8c4e858cd13196f9b371a2de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Problems come from a variety of sources, including Aizu and AtCoder (via CodeNet), and CodeChef, Codeforces, and HackerEarth (via description2code)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6aed6b1346bc2f63ac9b03e51c7a40ed94412758edbe31afd24937aed829b2bf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The execution subdirectory contains code for executing a solution and evaluating whether it solves a problem, demonstrated by the solve_example target."},{"claim_ids":["clm_82a1cb02c21a0a33e27a3559724a1a9b210edbb45df6e41b20a1aef123df90ed"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The dataset has three splits: Training (sharded as code_contests_train.riegeli-*-of-00128), Validation, and Test, each with its own Riegeli filename."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8b3ad3c8cf0c9590c8d272909248dace1909b758a39054524c41ca50039c9b87"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Example code iterates the dataset in C++ (print_names.cc) and Python (print_names_and_sources.py), runnable via bazel to print problem names and sources."}],"claim_ids":["clm_07c2fe0eeb7dd3b3e50d6f3e3ee07bae15f6d9cecd85064e41d47a2e6b999c73","clm_0b9ab5d50e1a1a887dad8db121ddcb8a16735adc9e978b77f6c423fdc524bc73","clm_1b7f04d36f08057e4252ac736d43103c706ea032ada072818dae44ce2581f1c8","clm_2df4093a9cebba46c03cda5c437d2f064020739e09051d55a20bef9cc3697daa","clm_344f4a70c35524f948999c54cdbcb5abe1a655f88a4b5fa9ff74b9db9c8b3301","clm_484d61549efb9f11c5b3c1bec2129f01055e61a406dbd96c0ee7cb997cab2755","clm_5f3e087ab877ed1d85c85610a931507edd27ae4fa49c0505cc1f3b7d3171131b","clm_5f4dd3fb28de0a20c6bc36f2fdfa5f3b9fae36bb8c4e858cd13196f9b371a2de","clm_6aed6b1346bc2f63ac9b03e51c7a40ed94412758edbe31afd24937aed829b2bf","clm_82a1cb02c21a0a33e27a3559724a1a9b210edbb45df6e41b20a1aef123df90ed","clm_8b3ad3c8cf0c9590c8d272909248dace1909b758a39054524c41ca50039c9b87"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:53:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_08dfd3b3941848cc9e8516464be4b02f","id":"pg_c3b4515bc7e45b549398e4745dc53fc7","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/google-deepmind-code-contests-